flowchart TD
    Start([🚀 Lite Test Starts]) --> CreateFile[📝 Create trace file<br/>test_logs/testId_date_runId.jsonl]
    CreateFile --> WriteRunStart[✍️ Write: run_start<br/>goal, url, limits, startTime]

    WriteRunStart --> InitStrategy[🤖 Initialize AI Strategy]
    InitStrategy --> WriteStrategy[✍️ Write: ai_strategy_initialized<br/>or ai_strategy_failed]

    WriteStrategy --> LoopStart{🔁 Iteration Loop<br/>max 20 iterations}

    LoopStart --> WriteIterStart[✍️ Write: iteration_start<br/>iteration number]

    WriteIterStart --> CheckCancel{❌ Cancelled?}
    CheckCancel -->|Yes| WriteIterEndCancelled[✍️ Write: iteration_end<br/>skipped: cancelled]
    WriteIterEndCancelled --> WriteRunEndCancelled[✍️ Write: run_end<br/>success: false]
    WriteRunEndCancelled --> CloseFile[🔒 Close trace file<br/>flush all writes]

    CheckCancel -->|No| CollectSnapshot[📸 Collect Snapshot<br/>url, title, elements<br/>NO input values]
    CollectSnapshot --> WriteSnapshot[✍️ Write: snapshot<br/>formattedSnapshot + liteSnapshot]

    WriteSnapshot --> CheckTransient{⏳ Transient State?}
    CheckTransient -->|Yes| WriteIterEndTransient[✍️ Write: iteration_end<br/>skipped: transient]
    WriteIterEndTransient --> LoopStart

    CheckTransient -->|No| BuildPrompt[🧠 Build AI Prompt<br/>snapshot + history + stuckCheck]
    BuildPrompt --> WriteAIPrompt[✍️ Write: ai_prompt<br/>full prompt string, model, tokens]

    WriteAIPrompt --> CallAI[🤖 Call AI Model<br/>gpt-4o-mini]
    CallAI --> GetDecision[📥 Get AI Decision<br/>thought, command, done?, blocked?]
    GetDecision --> WriteAIResponse[✍️ Write: ai_response<br/>decision, thought, safeCommand<br/>value REDACTED]

    WriteAIResponse --> CheckDone{✅ AI says done?}

    CheckDone -->|Yes| CheckAuditorCooldown{⏱️ Auditor cooldown?}
    CheckAuditorCooldown -->|Yes| WriteIterEndCooldown[✍️ Write: iteration_end<br/>skipped: auditor_cooldown]
    WriteIterEndCooldown --> LoopStart

    CheckAuditorCooldown -->|No| WriteAuditorPrompt[✍️ Write: ai_auditor_prompt<br/>goalContext, model: gpt-4o]
    WriteAuditorPrompt --> CallAuditor[🔍 Call Auditor AI]
    CallAuditor --> GetAuditResult[📥 Get Audit Result<br/>isDone, isBlocked, confidence]
    GetAuditResult --> WriteAuditorResponse[✍️ Write: ai_auditor_response<br/>auditResult]

    WriteAuditorResponse --> CheckAuditDone{✅ Auditor confirms done?}
    CheckAuditDone -->|Yes| WriteRunEndSuccess[✍️ Write: run_end<br/>success: true]
    WriteRunEndSuccess --> CloseFile

    CheckAuditDone -->|No| WriteIterEndNotDone[✍️ Write: iteration_end<br/>skipped: auditor_not_confirmed]
    WriteIterEndNotDone --> LoopStart

    CheckDone -->|No| CheckBlocked{🚫 Blocked?}
    CheckBlocked -->|Hard Block| WriteRunEndBlocked[✍️ Write: run_end<br/>success: false, blocked]
    WriteRunEndBlocked --> CloseFile

    CheckBlocked -->|Soft Block| WriteIterEndSoftBlock[✍️ Write: iteration_end<br/>skipped: soft_block]
    WriteIterEndSoftBlock --> LoopStart

    CheckBlocked -->|No| WriteActionStart[✍️ Write: action_execute_start<br/>safeCommand, thought]

    WriteActionStart --> ExecuteAction[⚡ Execute Action<br/>click, fill, goto, etc.]
    ExecuteAction --> WriteActionDetails[✍️ Write: action_* events<br/>validation, execution, modal_check, fallback]
    WriteActionDetails --> WriteActionEnd[✍️ Write: action_execute_end<br/>success, error, duration, fallback]

    WriteActionEnd --> CollectAfterSnapshot[📸 Collect After Snapshot<br/>+ errors from console/network]

    CollectAfterSnapshot --> ComputeDiff[📊 Compute State Diff<br/>before vs after]
    ComputeDiff --> WriteStateDiff[✍️ Write: state_diff<br/>urlChanged, added/removed/changed elements]

    WriteStateDiff --> ValidateOutcome[✅ Validate Outcome<br/>state_changed, no_effect, error, etc.]
    ValidateOutcome --> WriteValidation[✍️ Write: validation<br/>outcome, flags]

    WriteValidation --> WriteIterEnd[✍️ Write: iteration_end<br/>outcome, urlAfter, hasErrors]

    WriteIterEnd --> CheckLoopEnd{🔚 More iterations?<br/>OR goal reached?<br/>OR step limit?}

    CheckLoopEnd -->|Continue| LoopStart
    CheckLoopEnd -->|Step Limit| WriteRunEndLimit[✍️ Write: run_end<br/>success: false, step_limit]
    WriteRunEndLimit --> CloseFile

    CheckLoopEnd -->|Timeout| WriteRunEndTimeout[✍️ Write: run_end<br/>success: false, timeout]
    WriteRunEndTimeout --> CloseFile

    CloseFile --> End([✅ Trace Complete<br/>test_logs/testId_date_runId.jsonl<br/>ready for AI analysis])

